The container image installs the following CLIs as deterministic scanners
or intake tools (not as LLM backends):

- @alibaba-group/open-code-review (Apache-2.0), Alibaba
- deepsec (Apache-2.0), Vercel Labs
- @coldtea/pr-lens-cli (MIT), Coldtea AI — validate/render/canvas only
- GitHub CLI `gh` (MIT), GitHub

QA on the owner's Mac uses Plow Latch when installed; otherwise the
Zoen skill drives the same user-path inside this container. There is no
recipe-runner script.

Personality and memory ideas are distilled from
vellum-ai/vellum-assistant (MIT): five 0-100 axes (companion /
coworker, gen z / boomer, independent / collaborative, playful /
serious, polite / unfiltered) pinned in SOUL rather than exposed
as sliders; punctuation (match their casing, lowercase if they do,
no em dash, no period at the end of a bubble); first-run ritual
from their BOOTSTRAP.md, gated off once VOICE.md exists; per-turn
pack of VOICE / essentials / NOW.md matching their `<info>` +
`<NOW.md>` injectors; remember-the-same-turn and recall-before-
guessing (their `remember` / `recall` tools, as `memory.py` plus a
`<system_reminder>` on every dump); eight kinds of curated notes.
This agent does not run that runtime; the files live as markdown
under HERMES_HOME/zoen/.

Engineering principles on the floor are the 23 principle skills in
full, rebranded for Zoen, from pstack (MIT, Lauren Tan): office-hours,
architect, how, why, interrogate, blast-radius, tdd, figure-it-out,
arena, swarm, and shipping as separate Hermes skills routed by `zoen`.
Not the Cursor playbook runner. GitHub PRs and issues are `gh`,
not a wrapper. Spec and tickets follow mattpocock/skills (MIT)
to-spec and to-tickets, rebranded: one parent issue, vertical
slices, native `--parent` / `--blocked-by`. Domain skill lookup
is vercel-labs/skills (MIT) `find-skills`, rebranded: Zoen runs
`npx skills use` in the background, never installs, never the
owner. Never-block until
merge: high-risk merge waits. Stop on no. Do not delete
production, force-push shared history, or spend money unless
they asked.

